---Activate Passive Deposit Address
---
---Activate a passive deposit address so it accepts new payments. If a deposit
---address already exists for this merchant + withdrawer + chain + token, that
---address is re-activated and returned. Otherwise a new session is created
---and its address is activated.
---
---`POST /withdraw/crypto-deposit-address/activate`
---@param input coinflow.merchant.ActivatePassiveDepositAddressRequest
---@return coinflow.merchant.PassiveDepositAddressStatusResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:activate_passive_deposit_address(input) end

---Batch Refund Payments
---
---Queues a full refund for each of the given payments. Every payment is refunded
---independently - one refund job per payment, identical to refunding them one at a
---time - so a payment that cannot be refunded is reported in `results` while the rest
---still proceed.
---
---Partial amounts are not supported here, and payments needing a destination wallet
---are skipped with `skipped: true` on their result. Refund those payments
---individually with `PUT /merchant/payments/{paymentId}/refund`.
---
---`PUT /merchant/payments/refunds/batch`
---@param input coinflow.merchant.BatchRefundPaymentsRequest
---@return coinflow.merchant.BatchRefundResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:batch_refund_payments(input) end

